  "technical_internal_limitation": "The early kill test is confined to the Gaussian witness under the stated compatibility regime \\(C_{\\delta}\\geq\\bar H\\) and the explicit covariance, moment, score-variance, relevance, and \\(K\\)-interiority bounds. It must verify both compact-\\(h\\) whole-set coverage and the random retained kernel before the general multiplier theorem is pursued. Failure of uniform integrability for the score-band radius would preserve coverage but invalidate the expected-loss claims.",
